{title: Mere Haath Me Tera Haath Ho}
{artist: Sonu Nigam Sunidhi Chauhan Fanaa}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm] mere haath [Fm] mein,        [Cm] tera haath [Fm] ho
saari [Cm] jannatein,        [Eb] mere [Db] saath ho [Cm]
[Cm] tu jo paas [Bb] ho,        phir [Cm] kya yeh jahaan
[Bb] tere pyar mein,        [F] ho jaaun [Ab] fanaa [Cm]
[Cm] tere dil mein meri saanson ko jagah mil jaaye
tere ishq mein meri jaan fanaa ho jaaye,        [Cm] jitne paas hain
[F] khushbu saans [Cm] ke,        jitne [Gm] paas hothon ke [Cm] sargam
[F] jaise saath [Cm] hain,        [F] karvat yaad [Cm] ke
[Eb] jaise saath baahon ke sangam [Bb],        [Cm] jitne paas [Fm] paas
[Cm] khwaabon ke [Fm] nazar [Cm],        utni paas [Eb] tu [Db] rehna hamsafar [Cm]
[Cm] tu jo paas [Bb] ho,        phir [Cm] kya yeh jahaan
[Bb] tere pyar mein,        [F] ho jaaun [Ab] fanaa [Cm]
[Cm] jitne paas paas,        [F] dhadkan ke hain [Cm] raaz [Gm]
jitne paas bundon ke [Cm] baadal,        [F] jaise saath [Cm] saath
[F] chanda ke [Cm] hain [Eb] raat,        jitne paas nainon ke [Bb] kaajal
[Cm] jitne paas [Fm] paas,        [Cm] saagar ke [Fm] lehar
[Cm] utne paas tu [Eb],        rehna [Db] hamsafar [Cm]
[Cm] tu jo paas [Bb] ho,        phir [Cm] kya yeh jahaan
